sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent
    participant Master
    participant Worker
    participant Index as Indexer
    participant Dash as Dashboard
    Agent->>Master: Enroll and receive agent key
    Master->>Worker: Synchronize agent information
    Agent->>Worker: Send events on TCP 1514
    Worker->>Worker: Decode events and match rules
    Worker->>Worker: Write alerts.json
    Worker->>Index: In-pod Filebeat ships alerts
    Dash->>Index: Search alerts and state
    Dash->>Master: Query status or request action
    Master->>Worker: Coordinate supported action
    Worker-->>Agent: Deliver action via agent channel
